"Casting Spells": {
  "index": -95,
  "category": "sorcery",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Casting Spells"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Once I've made my "
        },
        {
          "text": "spell",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " using the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritual of Arcana",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": ", it's time to cast it.\n\nTo do so, I need to focus my will through the spell while holding it in my hand "
        },
        {
          "text": "(right click)",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": ".  It will drain some of my "
        },
        {
          "text": "mana",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the process, as is expected.  I can hold a spell in each hand, however "
        },
        {
          "text": "I can only focus on one spell at a time",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nOh, and I should remember to "
        },
        {
          "text": "label the spell properly",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " so I know what it is when I'm looking through my backpack.  I usually forget until I try to cast the spell for the first time."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": []
}